# ============================================================
# CONSULTATIONS
# ============================================================

### Get consultation stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/consultations/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{agent1Token}}

### Get all consultations
GET {{baseUrl}}/consultations
Authorization: Bearer {{agent1Token}}

### Book a consultation as a signed-in client (issue #180). The price is the
### agent's own consultationFeeUsd, quoted in the client's profile currency and
### locked for 30 minutes; any fee/amount/rate/currency sent here is IGNORED.
### Paid: 201 with the booking + snapshot (priceUsdCents, chargedCurrency,
### chargedAmountMinor, fxRate, fxRateAsOf, fxRateSource, fxMarginBps,
### quoteLockedAt, quoteExpiresAt) and requiresPayment: true, authorizationUrl,
### reference. $0 / no fee: 201, scheduled, requiresPayment: false.
### No usable rate, unsupported currency or a malformed stored fee: 503 PRICING_UNAVAILABLE.
### Agent not verified/available (or agency not approved): 404.
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "agentId": "seed-agent-001",
  "type": "initial",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-12-01",
  "scheduledTime": "10:00"
}

### Resume paying a pending booking (issue #180, the booking's own client only).
### Inside the 30-minute lock: the same checkout. After it: a fresh quote and a
### new checkout. If the current reference was in fact paid (even after the
### lock, exactly) it is confirmed; a late payment is flagged paidAfterQuoteExpiry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultations/{{consultationId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Guest booking from the public agency page (no auth). The agency's
### consultationFeeUsd is quoted in the default currency (NGN) and locked;
### the response carries authorizationUrl, reference and the snapshot.
POST {{baseUrl}}/agencies/public/acme/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Gina Guest",
  "clientEmail": "delivered+guest@resend.dev",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-12-01",
  "scheduledTime": "10:00"
}

### Verify a consultation payment on return from Paystack (no auth).
### 200 { verified, consultation } when Paystack's amount AND currency equal
### the stored chargedAmountMinor / chargedCurrency (idempotent: a second call
### writes nothing). 400 PAYMENT_MISMATCH on an underpayment or wrong currency
### (booking stays pending, nothing recorded). An exact payment that landed
### after the 30-minute lock is still confirmed (200) and flagged
### paidAfterQuoteExpiry on the booking and transaction for review.
### 409 QUOTE_EXPIRED only for an UNPAID booking past its lock: data has a fresh
### authorizationUrl/reference. A reference that is not the booking's current
### one (a superseded checkout) is 400 and logged.
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultations/public/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reference": "{{paystackReference}}" }

# ============================================================
# CONVERSATIONS
# ============================================================

### Get all conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{agent1Token}}

# ============================================================
# EXCHANGE RATES (issue #178) — prices are USD, charged in local currency
# ============================================================

### Public: current rate per supported currency (no auth, cacheable)
# Returns { base: "USD", currencies: [{ currency, exponent, available, rate, asOf }] }.
# `available: false` means the rate is stale or missing: show no local amount.
GET {{baseUrl}}/rates

### Admin: stored rates, active override and override history
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: set a manual rate (naira per US dollar). Must be within the band
### (default 10%) of the last provider rate. ttlHours optional (1-168).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rate": 1500, "reason": "CBN site unreachable, using bank quote", "ttlHours": 24 }

### Admin: clear the manual rate (the provider rate serves again)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "reason": "CBN is back" }

### Admin: accept a genuine large provider move (drops the stored provider
### rate, audited; the next refresh sets the new level, held to the plausible range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN/reset-reference
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "reason": "Genuine devaluation confirmed against CBN notice" }

### Admin: refresh one currency from the provider now (issue #214). Same
### checks as the 6-hourly schedule; audited; one call per currency per 5 minutes
### (429 with Retry-After otherwise). reason is optional.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "reason": "Undo a mistaken reset-reference" }

### Admin: hold (pin) a rate while the provider lags a real move (issue #241).
### While held it is THE rate (outranks any override); refreshes still store the
### provider rate for comparison. rate must be inside the plausible range (NGN
### 200-5000); reason 5-500 chars; ttlHours required, 1-168. Audited (hold_set).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN/hold
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rate": 1800, "reason": "CBN lags the market after the devaluation", "ttlHours": 48 }

### Admin: clear the hold (normal rules resume). Audited (hold_cleared).
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/exchange-rates/NGN/hold
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "reason": "CBN caught up with the market" }

